title Loan Application – Status Lifecycle
header v0.1 · Draft · 2026-10-09 · Owner: Product

[*] --> Draft : Applicant starts application
Draft --> Submitted : Submit
Submitted --> InReview : Completeness check passed
Submitted --> Draft : Documents missing
InReview --> Approved : Decision = approve
InReview --> Rejected : Decision = reject
InReview --> Escalated <<exception>> : SLA breached
Escalated --> InReview : Team lead assigns
Approved --> Disbursed : Funds released
Draft --> Withdrawn : Applicant withdraws
Submitted --> Withdrawn : Applicant withdraws
Rejected --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]
Disbursed --> [*]

state Escalated <<exception>>
